    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "Predict how many tickets the high school musical will sell, given a certain price point.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n\r\n- Complete the `loss` function. Prompt AI to help you if you need it.\r\n- Run your code.\r\n- Test your loss function on both the `predict_tickets_1` model and the `predict_tickets_2` model by changing which model is given to `visualize_model`. Compare the loss calculated for both models.",
